  "goodToKnow": "Ethisch means ethical: ethische Bedenken (ethical concerns), ethisch vertretbar (ethically justifiable). Die Ethik is ethics; in many German states, pupils who don't attend religious education take Ethik instead. The Deutscher Ethikrat advises parliament on issues like assisted dying and gene editing. Don't confuse it with ethnisch (ethnic). Kant's ethics, with the categorical imperative, remains a cornerstone."
